## Related errors {% #errors %}

- [TOO_MANY_ATTACK_PLUGINS](/errors/#too-many-attack-plugins): more attack plugins are on than your cap allows, so the bot does not start.
- [PLUGIN_ATTACK_CAP](/errors/#plugin-attack-cap): the settings do not save because too many attack plugins are on.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_CASTLE](/errors/#plugin-option-castle): **Castle to attack from** names a castle the account no longer has.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ARMY](/errors/#plugin-option-army): the army setting can't be read.
